    "Name": "Zephyr HVT",
    "Details": "Designed in 2620 to be a medium-duty, fast response, infantry support tank, the Zephyr boasts above average armor and speed for it's role, making it a capable skirmisher. The SLDF saw it as the perfect escort for it's Chaparral artillery tank and requested that an ECM suite be fitted to aid in laying ambushes.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 9/14 hexes / 270/420 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       150     20\n<b>Left</b>         130     20\n<b>Right</b>       130     20\n<b>Rear</b>        100     20\n<b>Turret</b>      145     20\n\n<b>Total</b>      655    100</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Improved Jammer</color>",
